Query:
--Description: Final template — list every ZIP code in the U.S. with the count of named hurricanes
--that tracked within 50 km, plus an alphabetically ordered list of those names.  Unnamed storms are
--excluded.  Validates coordinates and casts ZIP geometry to GEOGRAPHY for ST_DWITHIN.
